5,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Let's begin by establishing a calm and orderly discussion. Since we have no information yet, I suggest we observe each other's communication styles.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,It's a pleasure to be with you all. Let's be kind to one another while we solve this little mystery together.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Minako. A logical baseline is essential. I'll be paying close attention to any inconsistencies that arise as the days progress.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A most prudent start. I shall enjoy observing the various masks we all wear. I believe a touch of patience will be our greatest ally.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,This is so exciting! I'll do my best to help everyone! Let's all be honest and work together to find the wolf!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, your enthusiasm is appreciated, but let's ensure it doesn't lead to hasty conclusions. We must prioritize facts over feelings.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Hehe, Kenji is just full of energy. It's wonderful to see such spirit in our group.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, while spirit is fine, we must remain vigilant. The werewolf may use a friendly demeanor to blend in.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Mizuki. The most convincing predator is often the one who mimics the flock with the most grace.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not a predator! I just want us all to win! @Minako, I'll try my best to stay calm, I promise!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minako,,"I appreciate that, Kenji. Now, let's consider the Seer. The first divination happens tonight. We should be mindful of how information is shared tomorrow.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, the Seer! I wonder who it is? I hope they have a peaceful night and find a helpful clue for us.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,The Seer must be strategic. Revealing themselves too early makes them a target. It's better to let the truth emerge gradually.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. A Seer who speaks too soon is merely offering the werewolf a convenient target. Subtlety is far more elegant.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,That makes sense! We have to protect the Seer like a secret treasure! I'll be watching out for anyone acting mean!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minako,,We have a solid foundation for our approach. Let's end the day here and wait for tomorrow's developments.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Good night, everyone. Sweet dreams to you all.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I'll be analyzing today's patterns. Good luck to the Seer.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,I shall spend my evening in reflection. Until tomorrow.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Good night! I'm going to sleep so I'm full of energy for tomorrow!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
