34,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Good morning. The first night has passed. If the Seer feels it is safe to share their findings, now would be a productive time.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well. I wonder if our Seer found anything interesting?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I'm curious as well. However, we must be cautious. A fake Seer might claim the role now to steer the vote.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A valid concern, Mizuki. The timing of a revelation is as telling as the information itself.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm awake! Did the Seer find the wolf already? Please tell us if you did!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, please don't pressure them. @Benjamin, you've been very quiet. Do you have any observations regarding the current atmosphere?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Everyone is being so polite. It's almost too quiet, isn't it? Hehe.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, your playfulness is noted, but I find the lack of a Seer's claim slightly concerning. It suggests the result might be ambiguous or the Seer is fearful.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Or perhaps the Seer is simply weighing the risk of immediate exposure against the benefit of a swift execution.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Kenji,,Maybe the Seer is just shy! I'll be the one to cheer them on!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Since no one has stepped forward, we must look for behavioral cues. I've noticed that Benjamin and Mizuki are very aligned in their logic.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shizue,,They do seem to think alike. Perhaps they are just very smart people!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Alignment in logic is not collusion, Minako. It is simply the result of prioritizing rationality.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Precisely. If two people value evidence over intuition, their conclusions will naturally coincide.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I think it's cool that they agree! But @Minako is right, it's a bit spooky!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Minako,,"We must vote soon. Without a Seer's claim, we are guessing. However, I find Shizue's constant deflection through kindness slightly unnatural.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, Minako. I'm just being myself. I can't believe you'd think my kindness is a mask.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"It is a possibility we must consider. In this game, the most gentle face can hide the sharpest teeth.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"While I find the accusation premature, the logic of ""hiding in plain sight"" is sound. I will follow the group's lead.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I don't want to vote for Shizue! She's so nice! But if everyone thinks so... I'm confused!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
